### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004
@username = mericsarikaya
@password = test123
@suggestionId = 

### 1. Create Suggestion
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/Suggestions
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "AI-powered customer support system",
  "productFeatures": "Chatbot integration",
  "innovations": "Machine learning model",
  "feasibility": "High",
  "additionalInvestment": "50000",
  "company_ID": "c1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "segment_ID": "s1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 2. Get all Suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/Suggestions
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 3. Create Scoring (replace SUGGESTION_ID with actual ID from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/Scorings
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suggestion_ID": "962dc964-ba8f-4efd-be7e-566d73b9a588",
  "companyRnD": 8,
  "companyMarket": 7,
  "projectSize": 6,
  "roi": 9,
  "profitMargin": 7,
  "competition": 5,
  "success": 8,
  "strategy": 9,
  "differentiation": 8,
  "humanEnvironment": 6,
  "ownership": 7
}

### 4. Create Decision (replace SUGGESTION_ID with actual ID from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/Decisions
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suggestion_ID": "962dc964-ba8f-4efd-be7e-566d73b9a588",
  "decision": "K",
  "projectClass": "V",
  "projectType": "YI",
  "projectYear": "2025"
}

### 5. Get IdeaNumbers (to verify auto-generation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/IdeaNumbers
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 6. Get IdeaOverview
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/idea/IdeaOverview
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
